            "Optical/coax S/PDIF cannot carry it at all. Over HDMI ARC it only works when the TV/AVR advertises DD+ to the PC; otherwise Windows rejects it (error 0x88890008) and LegacyAVR falls back to PCM. Maximum 1024 kbps.",
            "Use it when the output device shows [DD+] (768 kbps is a good start). Otherwise use Dolby Digital 640.",
