            "Over HDMI ARC the PC only offers formats the TV reports in its EDID. Many TVs don't pass DD+ to a PC even if they decode it from apps.",
            "Use Dolby Digital 640 kbps (works everywhere), or DTS if the AVR supports it.",
            "0x88890008 unsupported format rejected fallback error"),
        new("Troubleshooting", "AVR shows PCM / stereo instead of Dolby or DTS",
