        new("Troubleshooting", "Lossless PCM 2.0: why is it not switching?",
            "In \"Lossless PCM 2.0 for stereo\" mode the output switches to PCM 2.0 after 1.5 s of stable stereo and back to your Dolby/DTS format when surround starts. The line shown here (and in the Output card) gives the live reason, e.g. \"the source has signal on C, LFE\" (Windows or an app is not sending plain stereo), \"game mode is active\", or \"needs WASAPI Exclusive\".",
            "Every switch re-opens the output, so the AVR re-syncs for about a second. Disable \"Speaker fill\" / virtual surround on the cable if it reports surround channels for stereo music.",
